WEBVTT

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.300
Built off site, and installed by 12 February.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:16.200
A central Y of curved setworks divides the gallery into three colours: dark blue, lime green and rust.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:21.400
Twenty-one display cases, an intro plinth and an interactive table,

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:29.100
made in our workshop in Setúbal from formaldehyde-free board and 12 mm acrylic, then left to off-gas.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.600
Delivered on Mondays in lift-sized modules.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.500
Installed with no hot works, and the collection protected.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.600
Handed over clean, ready for your exhibits, AV and graphics.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.600
Active Reflex and 4x4 Multitrabalhos.
